  "updated_at": "2026-04-14",
  "bio": "Ink Inc Tattoo Artist, situated at the heart of Kingston on 327 Wall St., NY, is a contemporary haven for skin art enthusiasts, specializing in striking neotraditional and black & gray inkwork. Embrace the welcoming atmosphere where both appointments and walk-ins are greeted with equal enthusiasm, available Sunday from 12-5pm and Monday through Saturday from 11-8pm. Step into this artistic domain by calling 845-331-1993 or simply stroll in to begin your tattoo journey.\n\n327 Wall St. Kingston NY 845 331-1993 call the shop or come by to set up an appointment. WALK-INS WELCOME. Sun 12-5pm. Mon-Sat 11-8pm\n\n327 Wall St. Kingston NY 845 331-1993 call the shop or come by to set up an appointment. WALK-INS WELCOME. Sun 12-5pm. Mon-Sat 11-8pm",
